# Crowdplay demo deck

@slide transition=fade duration=0.4
@bg color=#070b18ff
@crowd join x=100 y=80 w=1720 h=920
Scan to join Crowdplay
@notes
Welcome everyone while people join. The Presenter Companion is on its own port;
this audience QR and the voting flow remain public and unchanged.
@endnotes

@slide transition=slide-left duration=0.4
@bg color=#070b18ff
@crowd poll id=next-big-thing open=true x=100 y=80 w=1720 h=920
What should we build next?
- A tiny compiler
- A moon base
- Sentient documentation
- All of the above
@notes
Open the poll with O. Let the room vote before revealing results with V.
@endnotes

@slide transition=fade duration=0.4
@bg color=#070b18ff
@crowd poll id=superpower open=true x=100 y=80 w=1720 h=920
Choose your conference superpower
- Ship before lunch
- Debug by intuition
- Explain any type system
- Never miss the last train
@notes
Close with the winning answer, then reset with R if this deck is run again.
@endnotes
